msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"He thinks he can just boss me around! Freakin' Nagasaki\r\n"
"though... Like hell I'm gonna go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Mikio..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Go back to an honest life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"I heard you joined the yakuza because you hated your father.\r\n"
"You'll never make it if that's the only reason you're here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "But... sir..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Once a runaway, always a runaway. Isn't that how the saying goes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Yakuza live by strength of will alone, no matter what\r\n"
"the cost. Do you really think you're up to that, Mikio?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"If you want to stay in the yakuza, then let's talk.\r\n"
"What is it you really want out of this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Look, I get what you're sayin'..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"That I'm not up to snuff yet. That all I'm doing is gettin'\r\n"
"in the way of Rikiya and the old man..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"But this place is the only home I got. Honestly, all I wanna\r\n"
"do is be a part of the Ryudo Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"Aren't you just running away again? Don't tell me you plan on avoiding your "
"father for the rest of your life..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "So what if I am!? What's it to you, anyway!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Nothing. But what about the kids at Morning Glory?\r\n"
"Is that the kind of example you want to set for them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Stop! Or else... I'll call the police!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"What're ya whinin' about? Yer the one who needs to stop\r\n"
"the bullshit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "We know you've been snoopin' around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Yeah. In fact, we hear ya been diggin' up all kindsa dirt..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"If ya insist on keepin' that up, we're gonna hafta send ya\r\n"
"on a nice little vacation... to the bottom of the Okinawan\r\n"
"sea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Wait... Pops!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"What do you bastards think you're doin'!?\r\n"
"You're steppin' in Ryudo Family territory!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Ryudo Family? Sorry, but we can't keep track of all the tiny\r\n"
"two-bit families out here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"You disrespectin' us, asshole? You'd better get gone before\r\n"
"we lay the smackdown on you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Hey, what do you want with this man?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "You shut yer goddamn mouth! Or do I hafta shut it for ya!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Go back to an honest life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "So you want to stay in the yakuza?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Are you running away again?"
msgstr ""

